<LegalLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="Draft terms and conditions for ServiceNow Learn Easy."
  updated="14 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    These draft terms describe the planned learning service. They must be reviewed before any paid
    enrollment is accepted.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the service</h2>
  <p>
    You must use the service lawfully and only for your own learning. You must not attempt to bypass
    access controls, disrupt the service, or access another student's data.
  </p>

  <h2>Accounts</h2>
  <p>
    Account creation is not active in this preview. When it is enabled, you are responsible for the
    accuracy of your account details and for keeping your sign-in method secure. Do not share your
    account.
  </p>

  <h2>Course access and licence</h2>
  <p>
    A paid enrollment grants a personal, non-transferable licence to view the course while the
    enrollment is active. Course videos, notes, and exercises remain the property of their owners.
  </p>
  <p>
    Do not share lesson links, download paid material for redistribution, or publish course content.
    Access may be revoked for misuse, chargeback, or a confirmed refund.
  </p>

  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>
    Payment is planned through Razorpay. The amount shown at checkout is the amount charged. Access
    starts only after the server verifies the payment event. The browser success message alone does
    not grant access.
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    The refund policy is a draft. See the <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a> page. Do not purchase
    until the final policy is approved.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not attempt to copy, resell, or redistribute paid lessons.</li>
    <li>Do not probe, scan, or attack the service.</li>
    <li>Do not upload malicious code or unlawful material.</li>
    <li>Do not impersonate another person or the instructor.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>
    The service may be unavailable during maintenance or provider outages. No uptime guarantee is
    published in this draft.
  </p>

  <h2>Video and recording</h2>
  <p>
    Lessons are planned to use unlisted YouTube video. This limits public discovery. It is not a DRM
    system and does not prevent screen recording or sharing by an authorized account.
  </p>

  <h2>No certification or employment promise</h2>
  <p>
    Completing a course does not create a certification, a professional credential, a job offer, or
    a guarantee of employment. ServiceNow Learn Easy is independent and claims no affiliation with
    or endorsement by ServiceNow.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, the service is provided without warranties beyond those that
    cannot be excluded. The final liability wording requires legal review.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    These terms may change. A revised version will be published with a new date before production
    use.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for questions about these draft terms.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
